        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Siege</strong> is a  3D tower defense game where your mission is to hold the line against relentless waves of enemies. Build, upgrade, and adapt your defenses across four distinct worlds, each introducing unique enemy mechanics and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the campaign and climb the global leaderboard in <strong>Unlimited Mode</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>Four unique worlds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/20748a627983405bf4157de23bf288b5.avif?t=1783010824\" width=676 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each world introduces new environments and enemy types that force you to rethink your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>20 Campaign Stages</strong><br><br>Each world introduces its own mechanics and enemy types while building on challenges from previous stages. No two worlds play the same, and each pushes you to develop new strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>9 Core Turrets </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/5dc2d8323d5b9566c2e2eb1ebc7c8295.avif?t=1783010824\" width=899 height=629 /></span>Experiment with a wide arsenal of defenses, from rapid-fire guns to heavy artillery and unique towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>Over 120 Enemy Types</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/25148ea1f85b6c54154f50587c057ccb.avif?t=1783010824\" width=867 height=670 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face a massive roster of enemies with different abilities, behaviors, and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔹 Active Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/a36a4ee7ba82eb41efc2948ea1b41efd.avif?t=1783010824\" width=401 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take direct control of the battlefield with four devastating skills:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">AOE damage to clear groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Freezes enemies in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemies take more damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buffs all turrets in range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Skills can be upgraded via a skill tree, using points earned by defeating waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🔹Research Center</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/27118f5462a1d2bf4aa8ecf51c89f747.avif?t=1783010824\" width=429 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock permanent global upgrades that affect all turrets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Increased damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Faster attack speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extended range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stronger slow effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Reduced skill cooldowns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every upgrade changes your long-term strategy and increase the price of the next upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>Unlimited Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/45aa6470c10e454cb60bfd9e43c42886.avif?t=1783010824\" width=1434 height=782 /></span>Survive as long as possible against endless waves. Compete on the global leaderboard and prove yourself as one of the top defenders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>4 Special Turrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786810/extras/9f42bf96d308243e0ab9f6bcc4fb17f5.avif?t=1783010824\" width=664 height=680 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Four additional unique and special turrets to help you kill as many enemies in the unlimited mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔹 <strong>Global Competition</strong><br>Your scores in Unlimited Mode are ranked worldwide. Will your name make it into the top 100?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Why Play Galactic Siege?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging 3D visuals with strategic tower placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full tower defense experience: campaign, endless mode, and online leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for replayability with tons of enemies, towers, and wave variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a passionate indie developer committed to <strong>community feedback</strong> and ongoing improvements.</p></li></ul>",
